# Lₚ(s,f)=1÷(1−aₚp⁻ˢ+ψ(p)pᵏ⁻¹⁻²ˢ)

\[L_p(s,f)=\left(1-a_p p^{-s}+\psi(p)p^{k-1-2s}\right)^{-1}\]

Degree-two local factor at p not dividing N, for a normalized classical eigen-newform of weight k, level N and nebentypus ψ in the existing IAS reading notes. This is the arithmetic-normalized form and must not be confused with Xiannan Li's unitary-normalized factor.

